+
+`web-sig@python.org <http://mail.python.org/mailman/listinfo/web-sig>`_:
+    `Subscribe <http://mail.python.org/mailman/listinfo/web-sig>`__,
+    `Archives <http://www.python.org/pipermail/web-sig/>`__
+
